 "titulo": "The capital city sinking so fast they're moving it 🇮🇩 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "SINKING 25 CM A YEAR",
 "descripcion": "Parts of Jakarta sink up to about 25 centimeters a year, faster than the sea is rising. The cause is right under people's homes: wells.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#engineering #jakarta #indonesia #groundwater #shorts",
